# Implementation Plan: VARKA INTELLIGENCE Native AI Chatbot

Add a floating AI chatbot (**VARKA INTELLIGENCE**) in the bottom-right corner of the authenticated Varka dashboard. Unlike generic chatbots, Varka Intelligence continuously ingests live operational context (Tracking, History, Agent, Port Forecast, JIT, Fleet, Weather/Marine) and uses the backend Gemini streaming API via authenticated WebSockets to answer operational maritime questions.

---

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> - **Backend-Only Gemini Key:** The Gemini API key will be kept strictly on the Express backend via `GEMINI_API_KEY` in `backend/.env`. The frontend communicates exclusively through authenticated WebSockets (`/ws/varka-intelligence`).
> - **Dependency Additions:** In `backend`, we will add `ws` (and `@types/ws`) for high-performance WebSockets and `@google/genai` (or `@google/generative-ai`) for the official Gemini API SDK.
> - **Grounded Context Fallback:** If `GEMINI_API_KEY` is not provided or Gemini returns rate-limit errors, the backend context engine will fall back to an intelligent local grounded operational response based directly on the active Varka context, ensuring the dashboard never breaks or shows generic errors.

